This is a **Phase-3 gates project fixture** (G15-E2E-MARKER) designed to test the real OpenCode agent running on an Android emulator.

**Purpose:** It's a test/fixture project used by the OpenCode gates system (G1-G15) to verify the agent can:
- Run on Android under Bun-for-Android
- Access real shell, Git, ripgrep, and MCP support
- Inspect and explain a project (G15 gate)

**Contents:**
- `README.md` - Documents the project's role as a fixture
- `src/app.js` - Tiny module exporting a description function
- `notes.txt` - Gate testing notes (G9 git ops, G15 inspection)
- `g8-agent.txt` / `g8-write.txt` - Marker files for G8 gate verification

The project itself does nothing functional—it exists solely to be inspected by the OpenCode agent as part of the Phase 3 E2E gate testing pipeline.
